  "prefLabel": "En 1002.25 Group",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1002.25 “Group” means 2 or more applicant-facilities by the same or different interconnecting customers in a common study area to be studied simultaneously with agreement of all group member-applicants.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
